          "id": 1004693580,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Hi Alex,\n\nthe performance degradation was introduced in this patch:\nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/a21f1af336e9ca9ea1123f58bde22440253b8e66\n\nAnd that patch is not part of 3.6. So this fix here is not needed and would not even work for 3.7.\n\nBest regards,\nLars",
